{"name": "Port of Jumanah", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">F is for \"Friends who do stuff together\"!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is it wise to go on long voyages by yourself? Maybe. But a crew behind your back makes you look a little cooler. Recruit your friends to your vessel, and they will help you on your journeys. There is also a cat! What do they bring to the table? The only way to find out is to recruit them, but no way you're getting a CV out of any of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"474\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/0267326b913b4a0ead8099d8413589db.poster.avif?t=1786434016\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/0267326b913b4a0ead8099d8413589db.webm?t=1786434016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/0267326b913b4a0ead8099d8413589db.mp4?t=1786434016\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sail Away, Sail Away</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a multitude of oceans, each with a different environment and unique species. Find treasures,  defeat whatever is lurking beneath the surface, and be on your merry way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"474\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/4e53737e23c700c58b33717e458d4797.poster.avif?t=1786434016\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/4e53737e23c700c58b33717e458d4797.webm?t=1786434016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/4e53737e23c700c58b33717e458d4797.mp4?t=1786434016\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What\u2019s in the waters?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The depths of the oceans hide many questions, and among them - the most important one - why is everything in there so salty?! Prepare to meet unexpected friends and foes, have deep &amp; meaningful conversations, or simply kick them right in their fins. Will you let the seas push you around, or will your not-so-elegant breast strokes push you through the currents and challenges?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"474\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/20c77d0a33906e56be437a45975cecb5.poster.avif?t=1786434016\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/20c77d0a33906e56be437a45975cecb5.webm?t=1786434016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/20c77d0a33906e56be437a45975cecb5.mp4?t=1786434016\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rise from zero to\u2026? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete missions to upgrade your kit to complete even more missions. That\u2019s called a gameplay loop, baby! Unlock new abilities and gear to help you out during your descents into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"474\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/ef1f19bb201f1cb87732f2837300a8db.poster.avif?t=1786434016\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/ef1f19bb201f1cb87732f2837300a8db.webm?t=1786434016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/extras/ef1f19bb201f1cb87732f2837300a8db.mp4?t=1786434016\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Pearl diving is an ancient tradition... until you showed up. Dive into the depths, poke things you probably shouldn't, battle sea monsters, recruit questionable allies, upgrade your gear, rebuild your port, and make increasingly questionable decisions in this roguelite action adventure.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998920/d72137637d99816dd814d726b91fc47abc4fbea4/header.jpg?t=1786434016", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelite", "Action Roguelike", "Action-Adventure", "Cute", "2.5D", "Dungeon Crawler"], "developers": "Red Dunes Games, Agate", "publishers": "Red Dunes Games, Agate", "release_date": "Sep 7, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2998920", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 February 2026 - Request Access\n\n1 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/XzOFZffasL4", "first_seen": 1771369200.0, "review_rank": 1183}